# The Render API keeps running as-is; its CORS allow-list only knows the old
# GitHub Pages origin, so the browser calls /api/* on our own origin and Netlify
# proxies it to Render. Same origin in the browser means no CORS grant is needed.
# Kept in sync with the [[redirects]] block in the repo-root netlify.toml, which
# only applies when Netlify runs the build itself.
/api/*  https://floboard-api.onrender.com/api/:splat  200
